<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-WORLD CUP STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-WORLD CUP STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TOURS, France 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Cup standings after</p>
<p>the Paris-Tours cycle race on Sunday:</p>
<p> 1. Johan Museeuw (Belgium)		  162 points</p>
<p> 2. Andrea Ferrigato (Italy)		 126</p>
<p> 3. Michele Bartoli (Italy)		  124</p>
<p> 4. Stefano Zanini (Italy)		    88</p>
<p> 5. Lance Armstrong (U.S.)		    81</p>
<p> 6. Fabio Baldato (Italy)		     77</p>
<p> 7. Alexandre Gonchenkov (Russia)	   67</p>
<p> 8. Gabriele Colombo (Italy)		  58</p>
<p> 9. Andrei Chmil (Russia)		     56</p>
<p> 10. Fabiano Fontanelli (Italy)	     54</p>
<p> 11 equal. Nicola Minali (Italy)	    50</p>
<p> 11 equal. Udo Bolts (Germany)		50</p>
<p> 11 equal. Pascal Richard (Switzerland)   50</p>
<p> 14. Gianluca Bortolami (Italy)	     47</p>
<p> 15. Max Sciandri (Britain)		   45</p>
